host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan mind -- a run says what impasse it opened holding
prompt Read Kyri and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, close open agent-closable reds, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, and send.
think Standfast first -- read crux/REDS.md end to end. Every row carries a CLOSED or LANDED marker; no agent-closable red stands open, so the line is clear for constructive work.
think The road ahead is the Microkernel Target double-seat, ordered ahead of Seasons A-H by Lindy-first crux-first, and its Equinox 1 crux is Caravan. The running thread is the grievance arc, and the newest log's recommend named the next question plainly -- what a run that INHERITS a forbearance does with it, opening it fresh or reading it as the boundary of what this pair of hands can settle.
think Approved my own design round on the arc's own precedent. Every note addressed forward in this arc has a rung that answers it from the far side -- owe to meet, reopen to reweigh, endure to heed -- so forbear earns the same, and the rung is the run that opens holding the impasse.
think Named it mind, per the Comlink tendency -- a plain warm word, one syllable, verb-shaped like every neighbour on the ladder. Grepped the tree first: mind appears only inside prose comments, never as a module, a type, or an identifier.
think The measurement follows from the harm. A forbearance sitting on the wire buys the next run nothing if that run never says it opened under one, so the number is impasses a run opened holding and never named, and it falls 1 to 0 while everything beneath stands still.
think Chose the safe order deliberately, mirroring reweigh: the mark lands in plan.mind first, is read back off the wire, and only then does the inheritance come down. A run that falls between the two leaves an impasse standing for the next hand rather than one quietly gone.
think Both measured runs pass .forbears this lap, so the rung below moves identically under each and only the minding parts them. That is the honest reading -- a run inherits an impasse, names it, clears it, and hands on its own.
think Proved four RED paths on metal beyond the folded five, each by building a control rather than reasoning about one. A planted control printed GREEN with no mark on disk at all and the witness's own file read refused it by name.
think The ladder-copy meter went RED on the fold count -- 640 rather than the pinned 601 -- which is the guard doing exactly its job. Repinned to the measured number and updated the prose beside it.
obs The rung carried 2,186 lines rather than the 1,637 a rung the fold's first laps averaged, because each new rung keeps home the whole check chain that tails into the check it invented, and that chain lengthens by one every lap. Headroom is now 4,003 lines against the 22,000 ceiling -- under two rungs. Option B, the shared harness, is the move that ends the growth, and it waits on Keaton's word.
obs A subtlety worth recording: the inherited forbearance and the fresh one this run hands on carry byte-identical content, since the same reader refused the same matter. So the taking-down is unobservable after the run, and the order property is proven where it belongs -- as its own wire fold, outside any run.
obs MindRested fires only as a fold, exactly as ForbearAllayed does one tier down, because the run returns early when the inherited word does not leave the matter standing. That is the honest shape rather than a contrived path.
loom witness=caravan_mind_witness result=GREEN rungs_registered=88 suite_wall_s=139 ladder_copied_lines=17997 ladder_ceiling=22000 ladder_folded_checks=640 ladder_modules=93 rung_growth_lines=2186
file caravan/mind.rye the rung -- Mind, minds_bytes, mind_refusal, unminded_impasses, mind_note, mind_the_impasse, and the three folds beside the wire fold
file tools/caravan_mind_witness.rish the witness -- the self-test read on metal, the mark read off the wire outside the run that wrote it, every number below asserted still
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung, so the choir hears 88 and a guard nobody pulls cannot drift
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish the fold count repinned to the measured 640, and the prose beside it made true
file caravan/README.md the durable record of the rung, and the honest note that the meter is now the binding constraint
recommend keep-going the arc has run one full turn of correspondence and now closes it honestly -- a matter opened, looked at, carried home, refused, handed forward, and finally named by the run that inherits it. The next constructive rung is what a run does when the impasse it names is one it has now named twice, which is where the arc stops being a correspondence and becomes a boundary. Yet the meter now says the shared harness matters more: under two rungs of headroom, and the growth is structural rather than incidental. Option B is a refactor rather than a rewrite, it is measured, and it wants Keaton's word before an autonomous rewrite across 93 modules.
